WEBVTT

00:04:59.567 --> 00:05:01.816
Uzmimo Martina Lutera za primer.

00:05:01.816 --> 00:05:03.413
Da smo 1500. god. želeli da znamo

00:05:03.413 --> 00:05:06.080
gde je Martin Luter,

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:08.222
morali bismo da ga pratimo
u svakom trenutku,

00:05:08.222 --> 00:05:10.309
možda sa perom i mastilom,

00:05:10.309 --> 00:05:11.985
i da to beležimo,

00:05:11.985 --> 00:05:14.168
ali razmislite kako to izgleda danas.

00:05:14.168 --> 00:05:16.290
Znate da negde,

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.736
verovatno u bazi podataka
telefonskog operatera,

00:05:18.736 --> 00:05:21.772
postoji tabela ili bar podatak u bazi

00:05:21.772 --> 00:05:23.860
koji beleži informaciju

00:05:23.860 --> 00:05:25.923
o tome gde ste bili u svakom momentu.

00:05:25.923 --> 00:05:27.283
Ako imate mobilni telefon,

00:05:27.283 --> 00:05:30.130
koji ima GPS, čak i ako nema GPS,